// ch01 (round 2, R2-1 / p30): `vibe new` writes exactly two files --
// main.vibex (the entry point) and vibe.deps, whose header comment
// names the `<name> <url>` vendoring lane (`see vibe add`). The
// scaffold directive runs the verb against a fresh directory under
// the harness's output dir and prints every generated file, so the
// scaffold's shape is harness data. This descriptor's own compile
// result is incidental; the directive is the measurement.
//! cli-scaffold: new
fn main with Console {
  println("p30 descriptor")
}
